Project contact
===============
Ari Gilchrist

Mathematical sources
====================
Neil Robertson, Daniel P. Sanders, Paul Seymour, and Robin Thomas:
the revised Four Colour Theorem proof.
Georges Gonthier and the fourcolor contributors:
the upstream Rocq formalisation and certificate data.

Isabelle development assistance
===============================
Anthropic Claude produced much of the initial Isabelle formalisation.
At the 2026-11-25 handoff, the inherited development was explicitly attributed
to Claude, except for the already recorded Codex contributions to Sew.thy and
Snip.thy on 2026-11-23.

OpenAI Codex subsequently completed outstanding mathematical and checker
proofs, certificate verification, final theorem assembly, build repairs, and
submission preparation. This does not transfer authorship of the inherited
work to Codex. The detailed development record is kept in the repository's
.four_colour_development/NOTES.md; it is not required to build this entry.

AI assistance is disclosed as development provenance. No claim is made that
an AI tool is a human author, copyright holder, referee, or AFP maintainer.
